        "answer": "Dear Michael,\n\nThank you for your inquiry regarding our LED Panel Light (Model: PL-6060, 40W, 600×600mm).\n\nWe are pleased to confirm that we can supply this model. Based on our past dealings with Global Import Ltd., we previously quoted this item at USD 12.80/pc FOB Ningbo for a 3,000 pcs order [2]. Given your target price of USD 12.50/pc, we would like to propose a competitive quotation of USD 12.50/pc FOB Ningbo for this 3,000 pcs order, which aligns with the volume you have specified.\n\nPlease note that our most recent order for this model (5,000 pcs) was concluded at USD 12.20/pc [1]. Should you be able to increase your order quantity toward that level, we would be glad to offer a more favorable price.\n\nWe can confirm delivery within 30 days of order confirmation, with payment terms of T/T 30% deposit and 70% against copy of B/L [1]. As per your usual requirements, we will supply with neutral white box packaging and outer carton marking [3].\n\nWe look forward to your confirmation so we can issue the formal quotation before your requested date of 2026-09-15.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\n[Your Company]",
